                 Customizing the Install program

                 (This is for a 60K CP/M system)

     Edit both DRV1.ASM, and INSTALL.ASM and set MSIZE=60
     (Note: the default drive ID is drive E and the default
            base I/O port address is D0H)
     Assemble DRV1, and INSTALL to obtain a hex file for each
     List the DRV1.PRN file and obtain the value for DRV1     
     


     DDÔ  INSTALL.HEX<cr¾    ;loaä heø filå intï memorù at 100H
     H0,D000<cr¾             ;find offset from 0H. (D000H,3000H)
     D000,3000               ;adä 1000È tï offset® (3000H+1000=4000H) 
     IDRV1.HEX<cr>           ;prepare to read in driver module 
     R,4000H<cr>             ;read with offset to place at 1000H
     G0<cr>                  ;exit DDT
     SAVÅ 1· INSTALL.COM<cr¾ ;savå botè instalì ¦ driveò aó oîe file

