6.2                     BIOS INTEGRATION


     Aî  instalì  prograí  haó  beeî provideä  witè  thå  LS-100® 
Howeveò iô ió besô tï incorporatå thå LS-10° driveò directlù intï 
youò  BIOS®  Thió maù oò maù noô bå á trivaì tasë baseä  oî  youò 
experiencå  witè  CP/Í anä assemblù languagå programming®  Iô  ió 
mosô  importanô  thaô  yoõ havå á sourcå  listinç  oæ  youò  BIOÓ 
beforå attemptinç modification® Iæ yoõ havå neveò modifieä á BIOÓ 
beforå  theî  obtaiî  á copù oæ thå CP/Í  alteratioî  guidå  froí 
DIGITAÌ RESEARCH® Sectioî ³  oæ thå alteratioî guidå wilì providå 
alì thå nessarù informatioî tï regeneratå youò BIOS.


     Thå  followinç  exampleó  havå  beeî  provideä  tï  aiä  thå  
systemó programmeò tï integratå thå LS-10° driveò modulå directlù 
intï thå BIOS® 

»     DRVIÄ ió Equateä tï thå numbeò oæ thå drivå thaô thå LS-10° 
;boarä  wilì emulate®  Thió shoulä bå thå nexô logicaì  drivå  iî 
;youò  system®  Foò á ² drivå systeí DRVIÄ woulä bå seô tï 0² foò 
;drivå C® 
;
DRVID     EQU       (01-15)        ;DRIVE ID. (B-P)
;
;    The following equates define the LS-100 hardware
;
PBASE     EQU       0D0H           ;DEFAULT BASE PORT ADDRESS
REG0      EQU       PBASE          ;DATA TRANSFER PORT
REG1      EQU       PBASE+1        ;MSB ADDRESS REGISTER
REG2      EQU       PBASE+2        ;LSB ADDRESS REGISTER
REG3      EQU       PBASE+3        ;BYTE LOCATION REGISTER
NBYTES    EQU       128            ;BYTES/TRANSFER (FIXED)
;
;
;
»    Thió routinå checkó thå activå drivå bytå tï seå iæ thå BDOÓ 
;is accessing the LS-100 board.
;
CHECK:    LDA       UNIT           ;GET ACTIVE #
          CPI       DRVID          ;CHECK FOR LS-100
          RET
.fo                            Page VI-3
.paŠ.he                                               Section VI


;
»    Thå  heaä  homå routinå ió modifieä tï checë foò thå  LS-10° 
;boarä anä conditionallù skiğ thå floppù disë controlleò routine® 
;Thå  LS-10° boarä haó nï heaä tï homå howeveò thå tracë bytå  ió 
;seô tï zero® 
;
;HEAD HOME ROUTINE
;
HOME:     CALL      CHECK          ;CHECK FOR LS-100
          JZ        HME1           ;JUMP IF LS-100 IS ACTIVE
          .                        ;NORMAL CODE
          .                        ;CONTINUES
          .
HME1:     XRA       A
          STA       TRK            ;SET TRACK TO 0
          RET                      ;NORMAL RETURN

»      Thå sectoò translatå routinå ió modifieä aó followó aó thå 
;LS-10° doeó noô requirå sectoò translation.
;
;SECTOR TRANSLATE ROUTINE
;
SCTRL:    CALL      CHECK          ;CHECK FOR LS-100
          JZ        SCTRL2         ;JUMP IF SO
          .                            
          .                        ;NORMAL CODE
          .                        ;CONTINUES
          .
          RET                      ;NORMAL RETURN
;
SCTRL2:   MOV       H,B            ;TRANSLATION
          MOV       L,C            ;NOT REQUIRED
          RET

;
;READ SECTOR ROUTINE
;
READ:     CALL      CHECK          ;CHECK FOR LS-100
          JZ        RD100          ;LS-100 SECTOR READ
          .
          .                        ;NORMAL CODE
          .                        ;CONTINUES
          .
          RET                      ;NORMAL RETURN
.fo                             Page VI-4
.paŠ.he                                               Section VI


;
;WRITE SECTOR ROUTINE
;
WRITE:    CALL      CHECK          ;CHECK FOR LS-100
          JZ        WR100          ;LS-100 SECTOR WRITE
          .
          .                        ;NORMAL CODE
          .                        ;CONTINUES
          .
          RET                      ;NORMAL RETURN

»     Thió  routinå setó uğ thå addresó registeró oî  thå  LS-10° 
;boarä foò á 12¸ bytå pagå oò "sector¢ datá transfer® Alsï thå HÌ 
;registeò  paiò ió loadeä witè thå DMÁ addresó foò thå  transfer® 
;Registeò  Â ió loadeä witè thå numbeò oæ byteó peò pagå anä  thå 
;checë suí Registeò (E© ió cleareä tï zero® 
;
;
SETUP:    LDA       TRACK          ;GET CURRENT TRACK #
          OUT       REG2           ;SET LSB ADDRESS REGISTER
          LDA       SECTOR         ;GET CURRENT SECTOR #
          OUT       REG1           ;SET MSB ADDRESS REGISTER
          LHLD      TADDR          ;HL=ADDRESS OF TRANSFER BUFFER
          MVI       B,NBYTES       ;B=BYTES/SECTOR
          MVI       E,0            ;CLEAR CHECK SUM BYTE
          RET
;
»     Thió  routinå  setó  thå addresó registers¬  anä  thå  bytå 
;locatioî  registeò baseä oî thå currenô tracë numbeò anä  sectoò 
;numbeò  iî  preparatioî tï storå oò retrievå thå checë  suí  bytå 
;thaô ió computeä oî eacè 12¸ bytå pagå oò "sector"®  
;
;
CALC:     LXI       TRACK          ;SET HL @ TRACK #
          XRA       A              ;CLEAR A, AND CARRY FLAG
          OUT       REG2           ;SET LSB ADDRESS REGISTER
          MOV       A,M            ;GET CURRENT TRACK #
          RLC                      ;MOD. 128
          JNC       SKP1           ;JUMP IF <128
          MVI       A,1            ;GET RESERVED TRACK #
          OUT       REG2           ;SET LSB ADDRESS REGISTER
SKP1:     MOV       A,M            ;GET CURRENT TRACK #
          OUT       REG3           ;SET BYTE LOCATION REGISTER
          RET
.fo                             Page VI-5
.paŠ.he                                               Section VI


;
»     Thió routinå readó 12¸ byteó froí thå LS-10° boarä  storinç 
;thå datá iî thå memorù buffeò pointeä tï bù HÌ  anä compareó thå 
;computeä  checë suí bytå witè thå valuå storeä iî  thå  reserveä 
;checë  suí areá oî thå LS-10° board®  Thå normaì CP/Í returî  ió 
;witè thå Ú flaç ½ ± anä thå erroò returî ió witè thå Ú flaç ½ 0.
;
;LS-100 SECTOR READ ROUTINE
;
RD100:    CALL      SETUP          ;SETUP REGISTERS FOR TRANSFER
RDLP:     IN        REG0           ;GET DATA FROM LS-100
          MOV       M,A            ;STORE @HL
          ADD       E              ;COMPUTE CHECK SUM
          MOV       E,A            ;ACCUMULATE IN E
          DCR       B              ;DECREMENT BYTE COUNTER
          JNZ       RDLP           ;UNTIL ZERO
          CALÌ      CALÃ           ;SETUĞ ADDRESÓ OÆ CHECË SUM BYTE
          IN        REG0           ;GET CHECK SUM BYTE
          SUB       E              ;CHECK FOR ERROR
          RET                      ;SHOULD BE 0

»      Thió  routinå  writeó  12¸ byteó froí  thå  memorù  buffeò 
;pointeä tï bù HÌ tï thå LS-10° board¬  computeó á checë suí bytå 
;anä  storeó thå checë suí bytå iî thå reserveä checë suí areá oî 
;thå LS-10° board.
;
;
;LS-100 WRITE SECTOR ROUTINE
;
WR100:    CALL      SETUP          ;SETUP REGISTERS FOR TRANSFER
WRLP:     MOV       A,M            ;GET DATA FROM BUFFER
          OUT       REG0           ;STORE DATA
          ADD       E              ;COMPUTE CHECK SUM
          MOV       E,A            ;ACCUMULATE CHECK SUM IN E
          INX       H              ;INCREMENT POINTER
          DCR       B              ;DECREMENT BYTE COUNTER
          JNZ       WRLP           ;UNTIL ZERO
          CALÌ      CALÃ           ;SEÔ UĞ ADDRESÓ OÆ CHECË SUM BYTE
          MOV       A,E            ;GET CHECK SUM BYTE
          OUT       REG0           ;WRITE CHECK SUM BYTE
          XRA       A              ;CLEAR ERROR FLAG
          RET                      ;NORMAL RETURN
